cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or summary.csv, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "mhlw-opendata-url-checker: staged validation of website URLs in Japan's medical facility open data"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-10"
authors:
  - family-names: Ma
    given-names: Tanuki
repository-code: "https://github.com/TanukiMa/mhlw-opendata-url-checker"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Staged validation (URL syntax, hostname syntax, TLD, DNS, HTTP reachability, and
  http/https scheme completion) of the website URLs listed for hospitals, clinics,
  dental clinics, maternity homes and pharmacies in the Japan Medical Information Net
  open data (Ministry of Health, Labour and Welfare, release 2026-06-01). The share of
  URLs failing at each stage is used as a proxy for how well domain names and hostnames
  are understood. Includes the figure script and the aggregated results (summary.csv,
  CC BY 4.0).
keywords:
  - domain names
  - DNS
  - URL validation
  - open data
  - medical facilities
  - Japan
